# Keep the Docker build context small + reproducible. The Dockerfiles run
# their own `bun install` + build inside the image, so host node_modules /
# build output must NOT be sent (1.4GB+, and would mask the clean install).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.git
**/*.log
apps/aggregator/data
apps/aggregator/fixtures
**/.env
**/.env.*
deploy/.env
.DS_Store
